वि-√ वच् P. -वक्ति (rarely Ā.), to, declare, announce, explain, solve (a question), RV.; ŚBr.;
to decide, Yājñ., Sch. (in explaining विवाक);
to discuss, impugn, MBh.;
 (Ā.) to speak variously or differently, dispute with one another about (loc.), RV.

वि-√ वद् P. Ā. (cf. Pāṇ. i, 3, 47, Sch.) -वदति, ˚ते, (P.) to contradict, oppose (acc.), AV.;
 (P. Ā.) to be at variance, contest, litigate, dispute with (instr., rarely acc.) or about (loc., rarely acc.), TBr. &c. &c. (Ved. inf. -वदे with √ या, ‘to be about to quarrel’; pr. p. Ā. -वदमान, ‘disputing’, ‘disputed’, ‘questionable’);
 (P.) to talk, converse, Hariv.;
 (Ā.) to raise the voice, sing (said of birds), R. :
Caus. -वादयति, to dispute or litigate, commence an action or lawsuit, Yājñ. :
Intens. (only p. वा॑वदत्), to roar aloud, AV.

or वी-वध, m. (prob. fr. √ वध् = वह्; cf. वधु) a shoulder-yoke for carrying burdens, TĀr.; ĀśvGṛ. &c. (cf. वि- and सव्˚);
 a store of grain or hay, provisions &c., Kāv.; Kām.; Pañcat.;
 a partic. Ekāha, Vaitān.;
 a road, highway, L. (वीव्˚, Pat. on Pāṇ. ii, 3, 12,

);
 a ewer, pitcher, W.;
 the income which a king obtains from his subjects, L.

or वी-वध, m. (prob. fr. √ वध् = वह्; cf. वधु) a shoulder-yoke for carrying burdens, TĀr.; ĀśvGṛ. &c. (cf. वि- and सव्˚);
 a store of grain or hay, provisions &c., Kāv.; Kām.; Pañcat.;
 a partic. Ekāha, Vaitān.;
 a road, highway, L. (वीव्˚, Pat. on Pāṇ. ii, 3, 12,

);
 a ewer, pitcher, W.;
 the income which a king obtains from his subjects, L.

वि-√ वर्ण् (also written वि-√ वृण्, q.v.) P. -वर्णयति (aor. व्यवीवृणत्), to excel in painting or description, Uttarar.;
to discolour, Jātakam.;
to dispraise, Divyāv.

वि-√ 2. वस् (cf. व्युष्) P. व्य्-उच्छति, to shine forth, shine, dawn, RV. &c. &c.;
 (वि-व॑स्ते), to illumine, ŚBr. :
Caus. -वासयति, to cause to shine, RV.; TS.; Br.

वि-√ 4. वस् Ā. -वस्ते, to change clothes, TS.; ĀśvŚr.;
to put on, don, Bhaṭṭ. :
Caus. -वासयति (Pass. -वास्यते), to put on, don, MBh.

वि-√ 5. वस् P. -वसति, to change an abode, depart from (abl.), BhP.;
 (with ब्रह्मचर्यम्), to enter upon an apprenticeship, become a pupil, ChUp.;
to abide, dwell, live, MBh.; R.;
to pass, spend (time), ib. &c.:
Caus. -वासयति, to cause to dwell apart, banish, expel, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to send forth, dismiss, MBh.

वि-√ वह् P. -वहति (rarely Ā.), to bear or carry off, remove, RV.; MBh.;
to lead away (the bride from her father's house), take in marriage, marry, AV. &c. &c.;
 (also Ā., with or without मिथस्) to marry or form a matrimonial alliance together, Gobh.; Āpast.; BhP. :
Caus. -वाहयति, to marry (a girl) to (gen. or सह), MBh.; Pañcat.;
 (Ā.) to lead home, take to wife, Kathās.; Vet.; Pañcat.

वि-√ विच् P. -विनक्ति, to sift (esp. grain by tossing or blowing), divide asunder, separate from (instr. or abl.), ŚBr.; ŚrS.; BhP. to shake through (acc.), RV. i, 39, 5;
to cause to lose, deprive of (abl.), Bhaṭṭ.;
to distinguish, discern, discriminate, KaṭhUp.; BhP. to decide (a question), MBh.;
to investigate, examine, ponder, deliberate, Kāv.; Kathās.; BhP.;
to show, manifest, declare, MBh. :
Pass. -विच्यते, to go asunder, separate (in. trans.), AV. :
Caus. -वेचयति, to separate, distinguish, Mn.; Suśr.;
to ponder, investigate, examine, Pañcar.; Sāh.

वि-√ 1. वृ (cf. व्य्-√ ऊर्णु) P. Ā. -वृणोति, -वृणुते &c. (in later language Ā. only intrans. or m.c.; in Vedaaor. often व्य्-आवर्, -आवो, -आवः; inf. -वरितुम्, or -वरीतुम्)
to uncover, spread out, open, display, show, reveal, manifest, RV. &c. &c.;
to illumine (darkness), RV.;
to unsheathe (a sword), VarBṛS.;
to part, comb (hair), HPariś.;
to explain, describe, comment upon, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to cover, cover up, stop up, MBh.; Hariv. (perhaps always w.r. for पि-वृ = अपि-√ वृ, q.v.);
 pf. वि-ववार (Śiś. xix, 100) = विवारयाम्-आस, जघान (Sch.)

वि-√ वृत् Ā. -वर्तते (rarely P.), to turn round, revolve, RV.;
to roll, wallow, MBh.; Hariv.;
to writhe in convulsions, struggle, R.; Uttarar.;
to turn hither and thither, move about (as clouds),

 (v.l. वि-वर्धन्ते);
to turn back or away, depart, part, sever, RV. &c. &c.;
to go astray, MBh. v, 2861 (v.l. नि-वर्तन्तम्);
to be parted (as hair), TUp.;
to change one's place, Suśr.;
to go down, set (as the sun), MBh.;
to come forth from (abl.), ŚBr.;
to expand, develop, ŚvetUp.;
 (with अन्तिकम्), to turn upon, set upon, attack, MBh. iii, 8438 :
Caus. -वर्तयति, to turn round (trans.), turn, roll, RV.; MBh.;
to turn, make or produce by turning (‘out of’ instr.), VP.;
to cause to turn away, remove, withdraw, RV.; AV.;
to keep asunder, RV.;
to leave behind, ib.;
to cast off (a garment), Divyāv.;
to accomplish, execute, AitĀr.

वि-√ वृध् Ā. -वर्धते, to grow, increase, swell, become large or powerful, thrive, prosper, RV. &c. &c.;
to be lengthened, ŚāṅkhŚr.;
to be lucky or fortunate (cf. under दिष्टि), MBh.; Kāv. &c. ;
to spring up, arise, MBh. :
Caus. -वर्धयति, to cause to grow or increase or prosper, nourish, rear, enlarge, augment, advance, further, promote, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to gratify, exhilarate, gladden, MBh.; R.

वि-√ वेष्ट् Caus. -वेष्टयति, to strip off (the skin), AV.;
to wind round (see next);
to surround, invest (a stronghold), Rājat.
